.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your cards beyond what should be possible and carve your own path through this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRY TO BE A HERO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tragic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving everyone may not always be the right choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own decisions and decide what kind of person you want to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, build, and combine your cards freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a playstyle of your own and begin your adventure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O Hero, Save Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-drawn deck-building RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889640/extras/b994e8acad3184f798427b349b133944.avif?t=1787728528\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pray. Save. Kill. Devour.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey and uncover the secrets of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >O HERO, SAVE ME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They pray for a hero to descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They pray for divine grace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But something else seems to have answered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=